WEBVTT

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:15.910
The wind today is even more fierce than usual.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.190
Lord Roid.

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:18.910
What is it?

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:23.100
Mr. Berger from the Epsilon Foundation has arrived.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.790
I see.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.000
Amplify the power of the song of the wind?

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.090
Yes. With the recent adjustments, we believe it is possible.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:41.310
Consider it an apology for falling so behind on analyzing the Protoculture's systems.

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:47.160
But using something like that would put a greater burden on His Highness' body!

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.300
That is fine.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:55.150
The analysis of Sigur Valens' capabilities is 45% done.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.410
Your patience shall be soon rewarded.

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:02.180
Fine. The wind shall blow.

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:06.000
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.850
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:12.710
<i>Let's share a selfish kiss</i>

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:23.510
<i>The petals of this flower fall in the wind</i>

00:01:23.510 --> 00:01:28.980
<i>The stars are more than I could count</i>

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:32.520
<i>I could place all the blame on you,</i>

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:35.270
<i>swallowing back my tears,</i>

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:40.110
<i>but I can't tell anyone about how my heart races</i>

00:01:40.110 --> 00:01:42.330
<i>(Reach out)</i>

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:43.620
<i>Until it all breaks apart</i>

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:45.570
<i>(Reach out)</i>

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:46.800
<i>Until you can take flight</i>

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:48.290
<i>(To the ends)</i>

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:49.170
<i>Deep in my heart</i>

00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:50.910
<i>(Of time)</i>

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:51.710
<i>There is a prayer</i>

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:54.630
<i>Just feel, just believe</i>

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:58.730
<i>and speed through it all</i>

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:01.890
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:04.640
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:10.230
<i>Let's share a kiss faster than light, just wait for me</i>

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:12.860
<i>I'll leave my body behind</i>

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:15.860
<i>I'll leave my heart beating hard</i>

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:21.290
<i>I'll break free from these chains holding me down</i>

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:28.000
<i>Just come get me, in my purest form</i>

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:40.570
Gimme two of those!

00:02:40.570 --> 00:02:42.300
Sure thing! That'll be three thousand!

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.300
What a cutie patootie!

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:47.200
The Ragnyannyan special: jellyfish buns!

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:47.480
Nyannyan buns

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.530
Grab one now for our once-a-year sale price!

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:50.840
Cheap as fire!

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:52.190
Delicious as bomber!

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:55.190
You can't find buns like these anywhere else!

00:02:57.070 --> 00:03:01.360
<i>Wavy waving on the waves</i>

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:06.230
<i>Waving wavy on the waves</i>

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:10.870
<i>Waving with him today</i>

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:15.130
<i>Waving with her tomorrow</i>

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:19.880
<i>Waving wavy on the wavy waves</i>

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:28.650
<i>Eat, drink, have kids, then bite the dust</i>

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:30.530
Freyja, you're the cutest!

00:03:30.530 --> 00:03:32.120
Give me some of those jellyfish buns!

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:33.860
Yay!

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:36.110
This jellyfish festival thing...

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.940
It's to honor of the Ragnan god of the sea.

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:41.430
That part I get.

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:44.050
This is also part of our mission.

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:46.820
We are to take part in the planet's cultural events

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:48.670
and promote friendly relations with the locals.

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:51.300
That's fine, too.

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:55.040
I'm just wondering why there are so many couples out.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:00.340
That's 'cause the jellyfish festival is an event for lovers.

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:05.200
Legend goes if a couple confess their love under the jellyfish on this night,

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:07.760
they'll be forever bound together.

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:09.980
Under the jellyfish?

00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:11.910
You'll see.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:14.740
Tonight, everyone's wearing matching underwear.

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:16.900
M-Match...

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:20.460
Rei-Rei, there are some things a lady shouldn't say.

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:22.950
Ain't no rule gonna keep this girl down!

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:25.660
Lovers...

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:27.450
Forever...

00:04:29.190 --> 00:04:30.550
Haya-Haya.

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:33.530
Do you know if Mesa-Mesa's coming tonight?

00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:34.860
I doubt it.

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:37.130
But he's leaving tomorrow...

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:40.980
He got reassigned to... the Aramis system, was it?

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:44.380
There hasn't been any Var outbreaks there so far, so one less thing to worry about.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:47.310
I bet he's gonna complain it's too easy.

00:04:47.310 --> 00:04:48.600
True that.

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:55.330
They're not managing their reflex engine well enough.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:58.900
That's the Alpha Platoon. I'll leave them a note.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.540
Is it okay for me to stay alive?

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:05.660
That's all that's been on my mind lately.

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:07.700
Why...

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:10.630
My apologies.

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:14.740
I couldn't finish training the Delta Platoon before leaving.

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:16.520
Don't worry about it.

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:20.500
Jellyfish babies quickly learn to 
swim even without their parents.

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:24.510
Messer!

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:29.930
I see. Packing?

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:32.810
We'll all go to see you off tomorrow.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:36.130
There's no need.

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:37.020
What?!

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:39.820
The Reaper himself?

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.480
Likes Kaname?!

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:47.530
Isn't the only song he has on that bracelet Kana-Kana's?

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:49.920
It's because he owes her his life...

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:52.410
No way. This is the Reaper we're talking about!

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:55.000
But Kaname's into Arad.

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:58.320
What the hell?! She's gotta turn into a cuttlefish first!

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:00.850
You three are so dense.

00:06:00.850 --> 00:06:03.340
You can't sing about love like this.

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:10.180
Does Captain Arad know about it?

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:12.360
What about First Lt. Messer?

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:15.110
Who knows if he realized?

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:18.440
Such a drag. If she likes him, she should just say so.

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:25.940
And this is why I'm entrusting you 
with this critical mission, Haya-Haya!

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.120
What?

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:31.640
I didn't expect you to actually come.

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:35.150
You won't be my subordinates anymore.

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:37.440
So what?

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:38.850
That's all.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:42.390
You manage to kill the buzz even on your last night out.

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:46.560
Can you keep this up without Messer?

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:49.000
Does it make a difference if I say no?

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:50.590
You're quick on the uptake.

00:06:51.350 --> 00:06:53.760
What about the ruins?

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:57.200
So far, they're saying it's just a regular pile of rocks.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.730
The research is still ongoing, though.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:02.190
They're after the ruins.

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:05.610
I'm positive they came to this planet for reconnaissance.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:08.780
Their attacks on places without ruins were just attempts at misdirection.

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:15.420
Lady M ordered us to bolster the 
defenses on Ragna and Al Shahal.

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:19.000
Those are the only two planets left that have ruins on them.

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:21.290
Al Shahal...

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:24.790
Hayate and Freyja were both there.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:30.470
Looks like fate bound Windermere and Hayate Immelmann together.

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:32.840
Same goes for us.

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:49.820
Ragnans sure are a cheerful bunch.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:53.640
You'd never guess there was an
enemy attack just a few days ago.

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:56.160
We're not gonna let a war or 
two get in the way of our fun.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:57.810
Look! Walküre!

00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:59.160
Freyja's there, too!

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:01.960
Love your songs, Freyja!

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:05.170
Thanksies! Thanksies very muchies!

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:06.290
Good luck!

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:07.290
Sure thing!

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:09.950
Fre-Fre's got a lot more fans now

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:12.800
and fewer people calling her a spy.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:14.640
She's having her break out.

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:18.260
So the wind's picked up your career.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.280
Oh, you!

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:26.220
I hope the wind helps out those two as well.

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:31.060
So you're gonna be a training officer in your new position?

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:32.320
Yes.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:35.620
They're letting me take my plane with me.

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:38.280
I doubt I'll ever get to fly in combat again, though.

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:42.270
Why did you get me to call him over?

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:44.780
You're trying to hook him up with Kaname?

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:46.430
Not really.

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:49.500
I mean, it'd be an interesting outcome,

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:55.080
but I just wanted him to have 
some happy memories with her.

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:58.960
No one knows what tomorrow holds for us.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:05.540
That's why we should enjoy 
the present as much as possible.

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:11.400
Carpe diem, huh?

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.080
What's going on?

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.550
It's starting.

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:51.890
Awesome deculture!

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:55.400
I see. That's what you meant by "under the jellyfish."

00:09:56.370 --> 00:10:00.390
Once a year, on every first new moon of September,

00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:02.910
the jellyfish come to the surface to lay their eggs.

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:06.210
It's one of the mysteries of life.

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:12.060
They're green... yellow...

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:14.880
No, the color of life!

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:34.480
If I could live a long life but not be 
able to sing to my heart's content...

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:38.950
Yeah, if they told me I couldn't fly to my heart's content anymore...

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:41.060
To my heart's...

00:10:43.460 --> 00:10:46.830
He's not the type to be happy being a training officer.

00:10:48.150 --> 00:10:50.430
What a sight! Right, Messer?

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:57.470
Kaname.

00:10:57.470 --> 00:10:58.720
What's that?

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:01.390
Axia.

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:02.930
This song?

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:06.140
I owe my life to this song.

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:13.730
Two years ago, your song saved me 
when I was on the verge of losing myself.

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:19.320
Thanks to your song, I got to live.

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:21.300
Messer...

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:25.970
From the bottom of my heart, thank you.

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:02.690
Lord Roid?

00:12:08.530 --> 00:12:10.580
Lord Roid, what are you doing?

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:14.520
His Highness needs to rest.

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:17.420
Keith...

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:24.890
It's been a while.

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:27.640
Have you ever won?

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:29.680
That was the past, not the present.

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:36.660
Amazing.

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:38.820
He can match the White Knight in a sword fight?

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:53.050
Do you intend to oppose His Majesty?

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:55.580
His Highness' life is on the line here.

00:12:55.580 --> 00:13:00.220
Shall a tragedy befall him, the 
great wind may take my life as well.

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:04.570
Once we've won this war.

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:06.590
Fold your wings.

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:11.640
I could feel your wind within my rune.

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:19.110
I shall sing and die, Keith.

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:33.040
Planet Al Shahal

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:35.270
Var outbreak on Al Shahal!

00:13:35.270 --> 00:13:39.670
The reinforcements fell under 
enemy control almost immediately!

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:43.560
Be careful! That song can be heard there!

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:45.600
Dammit! What's going on?

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:47.430
It's a lot more audible than before.

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:52.940
The Protoculture ruins are 
resonating with the enemy's song!

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:08.320
Where are you, Grim Reaper?

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:11.130
They've engaged the enemy.

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:14.400
The ruins on Listania are resonating too.

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:15.330
What?!

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:19.850
The song of the wind can be heard on 
Airberl and the ruins are reacting as well.

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:21.610
Same with Ionideth.

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:24.860
Hold on. I thought there were no ruins on Ionideth.

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:26.470
There are still reports of the song.

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:29.470
Bring up the starmap.

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:33.110
<i>Kiss, kiss, feel love</i>

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:36.010
<i>Kiss, kiss, feel love</i>

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:34.970
Crap.

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:42.160
<i>You can't reach the future if you never take off</i>

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:47.440
<i>Take me along to the end of space as you fly away</i>

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:52.120
<i>When I reach my hand out to you,</i>

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:58.930
<i>I hope you're going to pick me</i>

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:54.360
What's this feeling?

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:57.330
The ruins are reacting to our song.

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:01.210
<i>My heart is beating loud</i>

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:05.920
<i>Can you hear the song of life?</i>

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:12.640
<i>I'm sure it means the beginning is tomorrow</i>

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:18.680
<i>With love in our hearts, we spread this melody</i>

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:23.910
<i>As our blue star guides me to you</i>

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:23.690
Who's there?

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:28.390
<i>I'm still here, singing about our dream</i>

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:28.270
The interference is off the charts!

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:29.150
Watch out!

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:39.960
Where are we?

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:50.340
A hole.

00:15:57.810 --> 00:15:58.780
Mikumo!

00:15:58.780 --> 00:15:59.640
Fre-Fre!

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:01.730
What was that?

00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:04.730
This wind...

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:14.110
The winds have clashed.

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:16.000
The enemy's song has died!

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.130
Crush them!

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:18.280
Aye, sir!

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:19.020
In the name

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:20.120
of the great wind!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.920
They surrounded us!

00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:30.260
A pincer attack?!

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.090
I already miss Messer!

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:37.930
We're not gonna last.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.470
Wake up, Kumo-Kumo!

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:40.370
Kumo-Kumo!

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:42.570
Freyja! Can you hear me, Freyja?!

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.000
I can't lose them.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:48.440
Delta 5!

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:52.820
White Knight!

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:57.490
It's the White Knight?!

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:08.890
Got you!

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:15.370
Delta 5!

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:20.160
The small fry can wait.

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:22.590
Time to crush Walküre!

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:23.270
Da!

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:24.190
Roger!

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.290
Freyja!

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:34.780
I can't fucking shake him off!

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:38.890
I hoped he'd dance again.

00:17:40.090 --> 00:17:41.120
There he is!

00:17:44.050 --> 00:17:45.290
What's going on?

00:17:48.390 --> 00:17:49.420
No way.

00:17:50.050 --> 00:17:51.130
What?

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:55.090
Delta 2, engaging!

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:57.550
Messer, what are you doing?!

00:17:58.410 --> 00:18:00.520
I was briefed.

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:02.060
You're defying orders!

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:06.940
I'm still a member of the Delta Platoon!

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:10.110
Messer!

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:19.240
Got you.

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:23.290
What?!

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:36.220
Are you okay, Kaname?!

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:39.160
Lieutenant?!

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:42.010
Please sing.

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:44.060
Messer!

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:48.020
Please sing before I turn Var for good.

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:53.270
Kaname!

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:02.420
I understand, Messer!

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:06.810
Thank you, Kaname.

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:22.530
<i>This may be the last time I ever see your smile</i>

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:37.500
<i>Even the faces you make to other people were precious moments</i>

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:43.740
<i>In a world where the weight of a life is as light as a feather's,</i>

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:44.750
This guy...

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:53.790
<i>You are the reason I live for, and that's why I found you</i>

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:46.030
How the wind...

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:46.740
White Knight?

00:19:54.150 --> 00:20:01.340
<i>This pang of sadness is the axia of my heart</i>

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:07.970
<i>You soar through the sky with no concern for your life</i>

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:15.400
<i>You're like a rainbow that comes and goes in a moment</i>

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:25.880
<i>I love you, but I hate how I can never feel you close</i>

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:28.330
He turned Var...

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:30.620
And he's controlling it?!

00:20:31.180 --> 00:20:33.120
How beautiful...

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:46.260
<i>We're all born alone, and we all die alone</i>

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:37.170
He can match the White Knight?!

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:39.500
What a nice wind.

00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:42.970
I can see the wind.

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:56.690
<i>However, we can't live our lives all alone</i>

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:51.510
Freyja?

00:20:53.950 --> 00:20:55.560
Messer?

00:20:56.690 --> 00:21:01.030
<i>We seek each other's frequency</i>

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:07.480
<i>Love burns our open wounds</i>

00:21:07.480 --> 00:21:17.380
<i>The words I kept to myself came gushing out</i>

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:10.580
This is it!

00:21:13.650 --> 00:21:17.380
Reaper, so you're riding the wind as well!

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:24.880
<i>Tears are the axia lighting up the future</i>

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:31.640
<i>Ephemeral particles connect our heartbeats</i>

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:38.730
<i>You're like an illusion in a heat haze</i>

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:33.640
The wind?

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:49.150
<i>Cold-hearted, intense, and never real</i>

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:02.920
Messer!

00:22:05.120 --> 00:22:07.020
Messer!

00:22:18.280 --> 00:22:24.660
<i>Time may catch up with me and take me away on its ship</i>

00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:35.080
<i>But this yearning love still won't be purged</i>

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:42.470
<i>I won't ever have to recall you again</i>

00:22:42.470 --> 00:22:49.670
<i>Since I never for a second forget about you</i>

00:22:49.670 --> 00:22:57.300
<i>This pang of sadness is the axia of my heart</i>

00:22:57.300 --> 00:23:03.760
<i>You soar through the sky with no concern for your life</i>

00:23:03.760 --> 00:23:10.880
<i>You stole my heart and all my love</i>

00:23:10.880 --> 00:23:17.790
<i>Even if you may never find salvation in the depths of hell,</i>

00:23:17.790 --> 00:23:21.700
<i>No matter how far you are,</i>

00:23:21.700 --> 00:23:28.040
<i>I love you and I hate you</i>

00:23:28.040 --> 00:23:36.780
<i>I love you and I hate you</i>

00:23:36.080 --> 00:23:39.740
Mission 10: Axia Flash
